        "original_id": "434bca66-1da1-5a48-b4e8-7815161d44e8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Brian A. Miller\n- Organizations: Cartoon Network Studios, Nickelodeon Animation Studio, Hanna-Barbera, DIC Entertainment, Viacom, Nickelodeon\n- Places: Burbank, California\n- Roles: Senior Vice President and General Manager, Vice President of Production\n\nFacts:\n- In 2000, Brian A. Miller became Senior Vice President and General Manager of Cartoon Network Studios in Burbank, California.\n- Brian A. Miller is an American television producer.\n- Brian A. Miller previously served as Vice President of Production at Nickelodeon Animation Studio.\n- Brian A. Miller previously served as Vice President of Production at Hanna-Barbera.\n- Brian A. Miller previously served as Vice President of Production at DIC Entertainment.\n- Nickelodeon Animation Studio, also called Nickelodeon Studios Burbank in Burbank, is an American animation studio.\n- Nickelodeon Animation Studio is owned and operated by Viacom through the television network Nickelodeon.",
